<title>USA: YES! says product wins FCC approval.</title>
<headline>YES! says product wins FCC approval.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>YES! Entertainment Corp said on Friday the Federal Communications Commission had approved the company's V-Link as being in compliance with technical regulations.</p>
<p>YES! also said it agreed to pay $31,000 to settle claims with the FCC over its inadvertent failure to obtain FCC approval prior to V-link's commercial sale.</p>
<p>YES! also agreed to take steps ensuring it will comply with FCC rules and regulations in the future.</p>
</text>
